      "start": 0.45,
      "end": 2.22,
      "text": "Hello there, how are you doing today?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 8.94,
      "end": 16.85,
      "text": "A simple shape works well. A welcome from the officiant, a short story about you two, a reading or two, your vows, the rings, and the pronouncement."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 23.56,
      "end": 29.59,
      "text": "Usually the officiant, using things you've shared with them. How you met, what you love about each other, a funny moment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 37.85,
      "end": 44.21,
      "text": "Sure. Some couples do a handfasting, tying their hands with a ribbon. Others plant a tree or mix two kinds of sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 49.81,
      "end": 54.44,
      "text": "Then that's perfect. Plant a little tree in a pot during the ceremony and take it home."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 57.67,
      "end": 60.39,
      "text": "It gives your guests something to watch, and you something to keep."
